N5008 [class.base.init]/9-10, [dcl.init.list]: a braced default member
initializer of a class-typed non-static data member (`pair stored{-1, 7}`)
initializes the member via its constructor.  CBMC previously also synthesised a
default-construction member-initializer for such a member, failing for a class
with no default constructor ("found no match for symbol 'pair'").
